<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:space="preserve" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="リトルミラクル -Grip it tight-"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="立花響(CV:悠木碧)"/><amll:meta key="album" value="戦姫絶唱シンフォギア キャラクターソングコンプリートBOX"/><amll:meta key="album" value="戦姫絶唱シンフォギアGX キャラクターソング2"/><amll:meta key="composer" value="母里治樹"/><amll:meta key="lyricist" value="上松範康"/><amll:meta key="arranger" value="母里治樹"/><ttm:agent xml:id="v1" type="character"><ttm:name>立花響(CV:悠木碧)</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="line-0fc60ced-7de0-48a9-ba67-6c7e1a7e1d6a">寄宿着奇迹的机械装置的</text><text for="line-7bf2e30a-577f-4656-94d3-34a36cba0785">这只手臂亦有其意义</text><text for="line-7bf2e30a-577f-4656-94d3-34a36cba0785"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-2034da84-6e06-4b5b-a4b7-87e0db7a6158">(（有其意义）)</span></text><text for="line-061c5c9d-a252-4ff6-bb42-9378b18980c0">普通的日常 平平无奇的日子</text><text for="line-b09c56a8-5e51-4879-81f9-ce01b89da72a">为了那样一个梦想  </text><text for="line-b09c56a8-5e51-4879-81f9-ce01b89da72a"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-ec0080da-9489-46e3-aadd-fcbb68a0b9ad">(（为了梦想）)</span></text><text for="line-b905ff77-70c3-4d53-a6d2-2c64923a0a29">传递着温暖 </text><text for="line-b905ff77-70c3-4d53-a6d2-2c64923a0a29"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-4555467b-999a-45e6-87c0-736c19af6f99">(（温暖在传递）)</span></text><text for="line-e7c1f79c-903c-441b-8bff-eb4444d05ac1">就算不是言语</text><text for="line-e7c1f79c-903c-441b-8bff-eb4444d05ac1"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-65c76593-0a05-4b19-8d7e-2cf74df7b6c7">(（即使不是言语）)</span></text><text for="line-5505de08-40e6-4548-902a-08729c02adbc">拳头暗藏的答案  </text><text for="line-b16eec07-b405-492d-a26e-99e2226d940d">无需武器的答案  </text><text for="line-9fd6078b-d1a5-4980-a0f6-31c2f654c791">就是倾注「一击必爱」的 Love Song </text><text for="line-ed7f6239-8638-4347-9992-91d56bf6cbd1">相信正义 紧握双手</text><text for="line-ed7f6239-8638-4347-9992-91d56bf6cbd1"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-58529a2c-2c3c-49bc-9b97-361f965641b4">(（相信正义 紧握双手）)</span></text><text for="line-c02642bc-0be1-411a-9c9a-8d8cc053719f">即使被破坏 重新来过就好</text><text for="line-e1bdbbf8-6f8e-4723-8376-1ed5c6fc92f8">已经没有关系 小事一桩</text><text for="line-e1bdbbf8-6f8e-4723-8376-1ed5c6fc92f8"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-6dbef74a-7257-46c1-9e8a-ac4d390f65c7">(（没有关系 小事一桩）)</span></text><text for="line-1b4c0a59-3b85-4551-acad-6d1f72d959bd">心灵互相共鸣</text><text for="line-ba3afd91-09c8-4667-9509-61176041fa20">仅存的一点勇气也是「勇气」</text><text for="line-d6b4c322-1386-4e7a-a30d-f083c1e76d1f">令人落泪般地 紧紧凝聚成爱</text><text for="line-846eb1bd-5224-445f-827e-89fb67313f51">曾想要被托付</text><text for="line-846eb1bd-5224-445f-827e-89fb67313f51">曾渴望被拥抱</text><text for="line-43fc180b-441d-429e-9ceb-fb94ce334c18">想要被宽大的手夸奖</text><text for="line-43fc180b-441d-429e-9ceb-fb94ce334c18"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-fc36979e-49a5-4325-bf94-37ae5667cd65">(（没关系）)</span></text><text for="line-e6e11036-9250-40cb-ac1b-2f1600b6f19b">想要保持着坚强 把这份真心话</text><text for="line-e66bad09-222b-45fd-9eba-144f2b20d78c">不顾一切地倾泻而出</text><text for="line-c962ef7f-4c6c-46a5-82c2-7155bcfd1df6">无论何时都一直收到着</text><text for="line-c962ef7f-4c6c-46a5-82c2-7155bcfd1df6"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-11ee019a-7cc2-4e4a-a000-d97bd4b76c4d">(（无论何时都一直收到着）)</span></text><text for="line-0d9c05f0-73c4-4563-9f2d-56bfdd749fc9">珍贵的温暖之物 </text><text for="line-0d9c05f0-73c4-4563-9f2d-56bfdd749fc9"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-b70bd84c-7817-4232-a70e-1ea4297fe6e4">(（重要的温暖之物）)</span></text><text for="line-64f925a2-a99a-4266-9dfe-7a8f2aa0c2cb">告诉着我不要认输</text><text for="line-5f151d55-1bae-409a-a197-dc3d233a86e5">告诉着我去收下吧</text><text for="line-e904e389-9710-4407-a76a-3157a1273870">灼热着胸膛的最爱的 Love Call</text><text for="line-77c1a0e3-8690-49f2-9fee-c9ba7bed936e">绝不会那么轻易地放开手</text><text for="line-77c1a0e3-8690-49f2-9fee-c9ba7bed936e"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-4b666d71-e8b7-46cf-b15e-2af9793e9b2e">(（绝不会那么轻易地放开手）)</span></text><text for="line-8d53f437-4d9d-4402-8ad0-50af669e4fe2">那就是我找到的道路</text><text for="line-d3e73637-cd4a-4af4-8dab-e5b460598456">伤害着 也被伤害着</text><text for="line-d3e73637-cd4a-4af4-8dab-e5b460598456"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-d77b1793-cc75-4a12-9936-11bf49fbc4b5">(（互相伤害着 ）)</span></text><text for="line-f4837b36-22d7-4f16-be95-78c7ab3706ab">磨砺出的牵绊的话</text><text for="line-a177e6f2-c0a0-4561-ae41-4eb4fdfad926">那将会比任何事物都更加闪耀</text><text for="line-737f53fa-883c-496c-8330-7490ac85d1b1">我再次站起来…! 向着明天</text><text for="line-5d75ebd4-296e-43ae-8a4e-698bda8956a8">从今往后于此处开始</text><text for="line-b19cc99e-d278-4a19-a386-7a8a3bc9e8e0">全心全意地歌唱吧</text><text for="line-f1958f53-fdaf-4a53-854a-cdd2decf0162">爱意回响着 强烈地回响着</text><text for="line-4e7213f7-bba4-477c-93f9-069a5e607bd5">以紧握着的分量 以紧牵着的分量</text><text for="line-85135e9a-5370-46f2-95b5-0fb78349bb1a">就算没有言语</text><text for="line-d15bbd95-f711-4436-b30f-d088d0e7303a">就算不是言语</text><text for="line-a560b9e5-1a07-4ed6-8519-5178f4f4767a">向着心灵的 向着天空的</text><text for="line-38fa3c12-e0cd-4329-98dd-fe8f3c0c54e6">这份思绪啊…!</text><text for="line-5a350b3d-46f9-4a1b-b318-d7eb60c92635">相信正义 紧握双手</text><text for="line-5a350b3d-46f9-4a1b-b318-d7eb60c92635"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-869c2219-075d-4145-ae6d-6de111a67c08">(（相信正义 紧握双手）)</span></text><text for="line-e6273737-f773-4b2d-8640-316d578a8ead">即使被破坏 重新来过就好</text><text for="line-34a15e06-7dec-416b-a739-53195f9dd821">已经没有关系 小事一桩</text><text for="line-34a15e06-7dec-416b-a739-53195f9dd821"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-9467afe9-d40c-4b56-bb61-ca6183dcd48f">(（没有关系 小事一桩）)</span></text><text for="line-3794724a-3336-48de-aa16-735f5ab1d578">心灵互相共鸣</text><text for="line-7a5bad34-375a-4e08-a591-4f32d56095e9">仅存的一点勇气也是「勇气」</text><text for="line-d02afde0-bb95-4105-97b3-ce1bc7064860">令人落泪般地 紧紧凝聚成爱</text><text for="line-e66bad09-222b-45fd-9eba-144f2b20d78c"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="6472198c-1c7b-4277-9e07-40f8765f8d08">(（倾泻而出）)</span></text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="04:18.199"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-0fc60ced-7de0-48a9-ba67-6c7e1a7e1d6a" itunes:key="line-0fc60ced-7de0-48a9-ba67-6c7e1a7e1d6a" begin="00:25.942" end="00:30.423" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:25.942" end="00:26.123" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">奇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:25.942" end="00:26.123">き</span></span></span><span begin="00:26.123" end="00:26.443" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">跡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.123" end="00:26.303">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.303" end="00:26.443">き</span></span></span><span begin="00:26.443" end="00:26.603">が</span><span begin="00:26.603" end="00:27.060" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宿</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.603" end="00:26.756">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.756" end="00:27.060">ど</span></span></span><span begin="00:27.060" end="00:27.211">っ</span><span begin="00:27.211" end="00:27.483">た</span><span begin="00:27.483" end="00:27.809" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">機</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.483" end="00:27.809">き</span></span></span><span begin="00:27.809" end="00:28.283" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">械</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.809" end="00:28.003">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:28.003" end="00:28.283">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:28.283" end="00:28.443" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">仕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:28.283" end="00:28.443">し</span></span></span><span begin="00:28.443" end="00:28.745" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">掛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:28.443" end="00:28.745">か</span></span></span><span begin="00:28.745" end="00:29.035">け</span><span begin="00:29.035" end="00:30.423">の</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-7bf2e30a-577f-4656-94d3-34a36cba0785" itunes:key="line-7bf2e30a-577f-4656-94d3-34a36cba0785" begin="00:30.853" end="00:33.693" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:30.853" end="00:31.033">こ</span><span begin="00:31.033" end="00:31.153">の</span><span begin="00:31.153" end="00:31.313">ア</span><span begin="00:31.313" end="00:31.473">ー</span><span begin="00:31.473" end="00:31.631">ム</span><span begin="00:31.631" end="00:31.933">に</span><span begin="00:31.933" end="00:32.093">は</span><span begin="00:32.093" end="00:32.413" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:32.093" end="00:32.413">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:32.413" end="00:32.679" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">味</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:32.413" end="00:32.679">み</span></span></span><span begin="00:32.679" end="00:32.853">が</span><span begin="00:32.853" end="00:33.333">あ</span><span begin="00:33.333" end="00:33.693">る</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" xml:id="line-2034da84-6e06-4b5b-a4b7-87e0db7a6158" ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.086" end="00:35.238"><span begin="00:34.086" end="00:34.422" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">(意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:34.086" end="00:34.422">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:34.422" end="00:34.569" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">味</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:34.422" end="00:34.569">み</span></span></span><span begin="00:34.569" end="00:34.856">が</span><span begin="00:34.856" end="00:35.169">あ</span><span begin="00:35.169" end="00:35.238">る)</span></span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-061c5c9d-a252-4ff6-bb42-9378b18980c0" itunes:key="line-061c5c9d-a252-4ff6-bb42-9378b18980c0" begin="00:35.732" end="00:39.776" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:35.732" end="00:35.916" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">普</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:35.732" end="00:35.916">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="00:35.916" end="00:36.234" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">通</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:35.916" end="00:36.100">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:36.100" end="00:36.234">う</span></span></span><span begin="00:36.234" end="00:36.356">の</span><span begin="00:36.356" end="00:36.836" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:36.356" end="00:36.536">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:36.536" end="00:36.836">ち</span></span></span><span begin="00:36.836" end="00:37.309" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">常</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:36.836" end="00:36.996">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:36.996" end="00:37.309">う</span></span></span><span begin="00:37.309" end="00:37.516">な</span><span begin="00:37.516" end="00:37.596">ん</span><span begin="00:37.596" end="00:37.756">で</span><span begin="00:37.756" end="00:38.056">も</span><span begin="00:38.056" end="00:38.256">な</span><span begin="00:38.256" end="00:38.492">い</span><span begin="00:38.492" end="00:38.816" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:38.492" end="00:38.816">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="00:38.816" end="00:39.776" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">々</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:38.816" end="00:39.776">び</span></span></span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="